<view class="page home-page safe-bottom">
  <view class="brand-row">
    <view class="brand-mark"></view>
    <view>
      <view class="brand-name">原点智学</view>
      <view class="muted">小程序 MVP</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="hero panel">
    <view class="eyebrow">今晚作业决策台</view>
    <view class="title-xl">先决定做什么，再让孩子开写。</view>
    <view class="body hero-copy">输入测评、试卷错因或作业清单，系统先给弱点雷达和三分类；原小点只辅导“必须做”和关键错因。</view>
    <view class="hero-actions">
      <button class="primary-button" bindtap="goUpload">录入作业</button>
      <button class="secondary-button" bindtap="goDiagnosis">测一次弱点</button>
    </view>
    <view class="ai-label">AI 辅助生成建议；不替孩子写答案，不承诺固定学习结果。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="section panel">
    <view class="between">
      <view>
        <view class="title-md">{{isDemo ? '示例结论' : '今日结论'}}</view>
        <view class="muted">更新于 {{updatedText}}</view>
      </view>
      <button class="text-link" bindtap="goRadar">看雷达</button>
    </view>

    <view class="weak-list">
      <view class="weak-item" wx:for="{{weakPoints}}" wx:key="key">
        <view>
          <view class="weak-name">{{item.name}}</view>
          <view class="muted">{{item.reason}}</view>
        </view>
        <view class="score">{{item.score}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="decision-card" wx:if="{{topMust}}">
      <view class="decision-label">{{isDemo ? '示例：今晚先做' : '今晚先做'}}</view>
      <view class="decision-title">{{topMust.text}}</view>
      <view class="muted">{{topMust.reason}} · 约 {{topMust.minutes}} 分钟</view>
      <button class="primary-button decision-action" bindtap="startTopMust">让原小点带做</button>
    </view>

    <view class="empty-decision" wx:else>
      <view class="decision-label">还缺作业清单</view>
      <view class="muted">先录入今晚作业，系统会把任务分成必须做、灵活选择、可以跳过。</view>
      <button class="secondary-button decision-action" bindtap="goUpload">现在录入</button>
    </view>

    <view class="triage-strip">
      <view class="triage-stat danger">
        <view class="stat-num">{{stats.must}}</view>
        <view class="stat-label">必须做</view>
      </view>
      <view class="triage-stat">
        <view class="stat-num">{{stats.flexible}}</view>
        <view class="stat-label">灵活选</view>
      </view>
      <view class="triage-stat quiet">
        <view class="stat-num">{{stats.skip}}</view>
        <view class="stat-label">可跳过</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="section loop panel-quiet">
    <view class="title-md">一个闭环</view>
    <view class="loop-step">
      <view class="step-index">1</view>
      <view>
        <view class="step-title">录入测评/试卷/作业</view>
        <view class="muted">不用 OCR 也能跑通，先用文字把题号、错因和作业清单说清楚。</view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="loop-step">
      <view class="step-index">2</view>
      <view>
        <view class="step-title">雷达决定优先级</view>
        <view class="muted">弱点不是越多越好，今晚只抓最影响的两三处。</view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="loop-step">
      <view class="step-index">3</view>
      <view>
        <view class="step-title">原小点只带必须做</view>
        <view class="muted">不做通用聊天，不替写作业，只用最小提示攻关键错因。</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
